   "heading": "List of District",
   "text": "In terms of area, Bhadradri Kothagudem is the largest district with an area of 7,483 km2 (2,889 mi2) and Hyderabad is the smallest with 217 km2 (84 mi2). Hyderabad district is the most populated district with a population of 39,43,323 and Mulugu district is the least populated with 2,94,671. Telangana consist of 74 Revenue Divisions and 594 Revenue Mandals (Tehsil).",
